    { "message_id": 5003, "date": "2026-10-03T09:12:30+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "", "reply_to": 5002, "reactions": 0, "media": { "type": "sticker", "emoji": "🙋" }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5004, "date": "2026-10-03T09:20:14+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "wagmi", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5005, "date": "2026-10-03T09:34:07+08:00", "from": 7015, "text": "⚠️ 价格提醒｜BTC 1h -1.6%｜现价 $108,950", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5006, "date": "2026-10-03T09:52:41+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "gm gm", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5007, "date": "2026-10-03T10:08:15+08:00", "from": 7003, "text": "吐槽一下，给 agent 接交易所 API，key 的权限设计也太粗了吧", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5008, "date": "2026-10-03T10:09:02+08:00", "from": 7003, "text": "要么只读，要么能交易。交易一开就是全币种全仓位，我想限制成「只能动 ETH、单笔不超过 500U」，根本没地方设", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 7, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5009, "date": "2026-10-03T10:10:40+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "500U 也太怂了，梭哈啊", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5010, "date": "2026-10-03T10:12:33+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "+1，上个月在一家小所给 bot 开 key，交易和提币居然是同一个勾，只能硬着头皮全开", "reply_to": 5008, "reactions": 6, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5011, "date": "2026-10-03T10:13:10+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "交易和提币一个勾？？", "reply_to": 5010, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5012, "date": "2026-10-03T10:13:58+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "对，不点名了。后来只能加 IP 白名单，每天睡前心里还是发毛", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5013, "date": "2026-10-03T10:16:45+08:00", "from": 7007, "text": "我这边是另一种痛：一个 key 管整个帐户，跑了 4 个策略，有一个出 bug 就是全账户陪葬", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 5, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5014, "date": "2026-10-03T10:17:20+08:00", "from": 7007, "text": "想按策略拆子账户，结果子账户还得人工审批，一周了都没批下来😅", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5015, "date": "2026-10-03T10:19:02+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "做市这边一直是一个策略一个子账户，但那是机构通道。散户想给 agent 这么配，基本没门", "reply_to": 5013, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5016, "date": "2026-10-03T10:24:30+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "周末了，代币化美股又开始自己玩自己的了", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5017, "date": "2026-10-03T10:25:12+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "早上看某个热门科技股的代币版，比周五收盘高了 1.4%，现在又掉回去了。这价到底该信谁", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5018, "date": "2026-10-03T10:26:47+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "本质上 API key 是「身份」不是「授权」。给 agent 的应该是一张有额度的卡，不是你家大门钥匙", "reply_to": 5014, "reactions": 9, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5019, "date": "2026-10-03T10:27:30+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "周末美股不是休市吗，那代币的价格谁给的", "reply_to": 5017, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5020, "date": "2026-10-03T10:29:05+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "没人给，就是池子和订单簿里自己撮出来的。NYSE 不开就没有锚，偏多少全看那几个人的单子", "reply_to": 5019, "reactions": 5, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5021, "date": "2026-10-03T10:31:22+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "所以周末的价我一律不信，周末从不下单", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5022, "date": "2026-10-03T10:33:40+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "问题是用户不是你啊，亚洲这边的人恰恰喜欢周末和晚上买美股", "reply_to": 5021, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5023, "date": "2026-10-03T10:41:13+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "国庆高速堵成停车场了，服务区刷群中", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5024, "date": "2026-10-03T10:41:50+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "", "reply_to": 5023, "reactions": 0, "media": { "type": "sticker", "emoji": "😂" }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5026, "date": "2026-10-03T11:05:40+08:00", "from": 7009, "text": "通知一下：下周日（10/11）黑客松线下 meetup 的场地定了，园区里一个共享办公，能坐 60 人左右", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 7, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5027, "date": "2026-10-03T11:06:18+08:00", "from": 7009, "text": "具体地址报名后私发，报名表晚点发群里。要订餐，麻烦提前说能不能来", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5028, "date": "2026-10-03T11:08:02+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "非开发能去吗，我只会问问题 hh", "reply_to": 5026, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5029, "date": "2026-10-03T11:08:55+08:00", "from": 7009, "text": "能，来听就行，下午有个 agent 交易的 demo 环节", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5030, "date": "2026-10-03T11:09:30+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "管饭吗", "reply_to": 5026, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5031, "date": "2026-10-03T11:10:04+08:00", "from": 7009, "text": "管，披萨管够🍕", "reply_to": 5030, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5032, "date": "2026-10-03T11:21:47+08:00", "from": 7003, "text": "对，我就想要一张「只能买卖 ETH/BTC、日限额 2000U、不能提币、48 小时过期」的卡", "reply_to": 5018, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5033, "date": "2026-10-03T11:23:10+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "你说的这个链上早就有了，智能账户那一套", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5034, "date": "2026-10-03T11:23:45+08:00", "from": 7003, "text": "链上有，CEX 没有啊，我的流动性都在 CEX", "reply_to": 5033, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5035, "date": "2026-10-03T11:37:09+08:00", "from": 7008, "text": "国庆加班的路过，食堂不开只能吃泡面", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5036, "date": "2026-10-03T11:52:30+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "周末 agent 的真实状态", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": { "type": "video" }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5037, "date": "2026-10-03T11:53:10+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5038, "date": "2026-10-03T12:06:44+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "说回 key 的事，交易所不做细粒度权限不是技术问题，是风控和合规不想担这个责", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5039, "date": "2026-10-03T12:08:19+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "那就在外面套一层，别让 agent 碰到真 key", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5040, "date": "2026-10-03T12:21:05+08:00", "from": 7015, "text": "⚠️ 价格提醒｜ETH 1h -2.4%｜现价 $3,912", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5041, "date": "2026-10-03T12:44:37+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "国庆中午，犒劳一下自己", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 5, "media": { "type": "photo" }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5042, "date": "2026-10-03T12:45:20+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "这是啥，看着好香", "reply_to": 5041, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5043, "date": "2026-10-03T12:46:02+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "潮汕牛肉火锅，吊龙 yyds", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5044, "date": "2026-10-03T14:05:28+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "Hyperliquid 那套让 builder 自己部署市场的思路，我觉得迟早是 perp DEX 标配。最近 permissionless 新开的市场越来越多了", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5045, "date": "2026-10-03T14:06:51+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "刚扫了一圈新开的长尾 perp，盘口 spread 普遍 60–150bp，有的两边深度加起来不到 1 万刀", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 6, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5046, "date": "2026-10-03T14:07:30+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "那不是随便刷？冲冲冲", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5047, "date": "2026-10-03T14:09:12+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "@laowang_mm 老王你们不去报价？这 spread 躺着赚", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5048, "date": "2026-10-03T14:15:40+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "看着肥，吃起来噎。三个问题：1）库存风险，长尾币单边一走根本对冲不了；2）oracle 风险，喂价是部署方自己选的，被拉一次就是一片清算，MM 第一个被扫；3）没有借贷，空头那侧没法对冲", "reply_to": 5047, "reactions": 10, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5049, "date": "2026-10-03T14:16:33+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "所以我们现在不报。等 oracle 靠谱点、有借贷了在说，现在进去就是给知情交易者当提款机", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5050, "date": "2026-10-03T14:18:02+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "oracle 那条同意，自定义喂价被拉盘的见太多了", "reply_to": 5048, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5051, "date": "2026-10-03T14:20:47+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "所以现在 MM 少、spread 大，这不就是窗口期吗？等大家都进来就没肉了", "reply_to": 5049, "reactions": 5, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5052, "date": "2026-10-03T14:23:15+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "折中一下：只做头部几个新市场，按 oracle 质量 + OI 打个分，分高的才报，库存设硬上限", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5053, "date": "2026-10-03T14:24:01+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "这个可以聊，回头拉个表", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5054, "date": "2026-10-03T14:31:50+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "回到周末美股那个，我觉得可以做个「周末预言机」", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5055, "date": "2026-10-03T14:33:22+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "思路：周五收盘价做基准，周末用 perp 的 funding 和期货基差的变化反推一个参考价。不完美，但比现在的「没有价」强", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 8, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5056, "date": "2026-10-03T14:35:08+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "perp 周末也没锚啊，你拿一个没锚的东西去锚另一个没锚的东西？", "reply_to": 5055, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5057, "date": "2026-10-03T14:36:40+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "perp 深度比代币化的池子大几个量级，而且是真金白银在赌周一开盘，信息量高多了", "reply_to": 5056, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5058, "date": "2026-10-03T14:37:15+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "这个我们很需要，现在周末只能在页面上挂个「参考价仅供参考」hh", "reply_to": 5055, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5060, "date": "2026-10-03T15:02:33+08:00", "from": 7010, "text": "说下我对 agent 授权的想法，有点长🙏\n现在 CEX 的 API key，本质是把整个账户的签字权交出去：权限只有读 / 交易 / 提币几个大开关，没有币种、金额、时间这几个维度。给人用还凑合，给 agent 用就是灾难——agent 会出 bug，会被 prompt 注入，会半夜自己跟自己对敲。\n链上的智能账户已经有更好的模型：session key + delegation caveats。主账户签一份委托，写清楚这把临时 key 只能交易哪几个市场、单笔和每日上限多少、什么时候过期、不能提币也不能转账，执行时由合约逐条校验，超了直接 revert。\nCEX 完全可以抄这一套：主 key 只负责签发，agent 只拿 session key，限额写进 key 里，由撮合前的风控层强制执行。出了事最多亏一个额度，而不是整个账户。\n谁先把这个做出来，谁就是 agent 时代默认的交易所。", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 12, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5061, "date": "2026-10-03T15:05:10+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "小白问下，session key 和 API key 区别是啥", "reply_to": 5060, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5062, "date": "2026-10-03T15:07:44+08:00", "from": 7003, "text": "API key 是永久的大钥匙，丢了啥都没了；session key 是临时的小钥匙，过期作废，能干啥、能动多少钱都写死在里面", "reply_to": 5061, "reactions": 5, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5063, "date": "2026-10-03T15:09:20+08:00", "from": 7007, "text": "要是 CEX 能原生支持就好了，现在只能自己在外面糊一层", "reply_to": 5060, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5064, "date": "2026-10-03T15:10:51+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "糊一层也行：agent 只拿 proxy 发的 session key，proxy 拿真 key，每单先过一遍限额校验再转发", "reply_to": 5063, "reactions": 6, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5065, "date": "2026-10-03T15:12:30+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "proxy 也是单点，被打穿就全完。不过总比裸 key 强", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5066, "date": "2026-10-03T15:28:16+08:00", "from": 7008, "text": "问个 x402 的问题：在做 agent 按次付费的 API，一次调用收 0.002 刀", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5067, "date": "2026-10-03T15:29:03+08:00", "from": 7008, "text": "结果每笔都上链结算的话，手续费 + facilitator 的成本比收的钱还多，越卖越亏😂", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 6, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5068, "date": "2026-10-03T15:29:40+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "x402 是啥？今天全是新词", "reply_to": 5066, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5069, "date": "2026-10-03T15:31:18+08:00", "from": 7003, "text": "HTTP 402 Payment Required。服务端回个 402，agent 带着签好的付款再请求一次，相当于给机器用的收银台", "reply_to": 5068, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5070, "date": "2026-10-03T15:33:45+08:00", "from": 7008, "text": "Base 上 gas 是便宜，Solana 也试了，但 sub-cent 这个量级还是扛不住，一千次调用就是一千笔链上交易", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5071, "date": "2026-10-03T15:34:20+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "今天这群浓度有点高，我先去买杯奶茶压压惊", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5072, "date": "2026-10-03T15:35:02+08:00", "from": 7003, "text": "那就别每笔都上链啊。链下记账，开个 tab，攒够 1 刀或者每小时结一次", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 7, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5073, "date": "2026-10-03T15:36:30+08:00", "from": 7008, "text": "tab 的问题是信任，agent 吃完跑了谁买单", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5074, "date": "2026-10-03T15:38:11+08:00", "from": 7003, "text": "先锁一笔押金，像 payment channel 那样链下签 voucher，最后一次性上链结算", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 5, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5075, "date": "2026-10-03T15:39:40+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "本质就是 batching，刷卡也是日终清算，没人喝一杯咖啡结一次账", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5076, "date": "2026-10-03T15:40:30+08:00", "from": 7010, "text": "说白了就是给 agent 发一张预付卡，额度用完再充", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5077, "date": "2026-10-03T15:41:05+08:00", "from": 7008, "text": "行，我先试试押金 + 每 500 次调用结一次", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5078, "date": "2026-10-03T15:58:32+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": { "type": "sticker", "emoji": "🤯" }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5079, "date": "2026-10-03T16:12:47+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "补充点我们平台这半年的观察（自家数据，样本不大，仅供参考）：\n代币化美股的成交，一大半发生在美股收盘以后，也就是亚洲的白天和晚上。买的人主要是东南亚、港台、日韩的散户和小机构：想要美股敞口，但美国在睡觉，传统券商的盘前盘后又很薄。\n需求是真的，问题是流动性跟不上。亚洲时段盘口很薄，我们自己测过，2 万刀的单子就能打出 40–60bp 的滑点，周末更夸张。愿意在这个时段持续报价的 MM，一只手数得过来。我们自己也在补，但一家平台的库存撑不起来，得有专业 MM 进场。\n所以我反而觉得这是个机会：谁能把亚洲时段的美股代币流动性做起来——做市也好，做个时段专属的 RFQ 也好——谁就能吃下这波需求。美国那边的机构，不会为了亚洲的白天专门熬夜。", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 11, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5080, "date": "2026-10-03T16:15:20+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "流动性薄是真的，spread 也确实肥。但做市的前提是能对冲，周末能用的只有 perp，basis 一跳就裸奔", "reply_to": 5079, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5081, "date": "2026-10-03T16:16:44+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "所以我们在找愿意亚洲时段和周末报价的 MM，费率返佣都好谈", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 5, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5082, "date": "2026-10-03T16:17:20+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "插一句，国庆有人出去玩吗，我在家躺三天了", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5083, "date": "2026-10-03T16:18:02+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "亚洲下午那段美股代币的盘口我看过，薄得跟纸一样，2 万刀就能打出 50bp", "reply_to": 5079, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5084, "date": "2026-10-03T16:19:36+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "私聊", "reply_to": 5081, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
