    { "message_id": 5129, "date": "2026-10-04T10:00:40+08:00", "from": 7007, "text": "昨晚差点被 agent 把仓位全平了，人都傻了", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 6, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5130, "date": "2026-10-04T10:02:15+08:00", "from": 7007, "text": "说下昨晚的经过，现在手还有点抖：\n我那个多策略 agent 11 点多做例行调仓，其中一个子模块把「减仓 10%」解析成了「减仓到 10%」，还当成全局指令发了出去，开始逐个市场挂 reduce-only 市价单。等我收到告警，6 个仓位已经平了 4 个，剩下两个是因为撞上了交易所的下单频率限制才没跑完。我在手机上登录、找到那把 key、删掉，前后花了快 3 分钟。\n最离谱的是，这一切在权限上完全合法：key 有交易权限，没有任何单笔、单日、单币种上限，交易所也分不出这是「agent 发疯」还是「我本人想平仓」。\n如果当时 key 上有限额，最多亏一个额度就停了。现在全靠运气，这次的运气是频率限制给的。", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 14, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5131, "date": "2026-10-04T10:03:30+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "我去，「减仓 10%」变成「减仓到 10%」，这 bug 太真实了", "reply_to": 5130, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5132, "date": "2026-10-04T10:04:12+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "所以 agent 手里就该是一张限额卡，不是整个账户。昨天聊的就是这个", "reply_to": 5018, "reactions": 6, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5133, "date": "2026-10-04T10:05:50+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "亏了多少？", "reply_to": 5129, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5134, "date": "2026-10-04T10:07:03+08:00", "from": 7007, "text": "滑点 + 手续费 + 平掉之后又涨回去的，算下来亏了 4 个点左右，还好没满仓", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5135, "date": "2026-10-04T10:07:40+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "agent：我只是帮你提前止盈了🤖", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5136, "date": "2026-10-04T10:09:40+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "这事说明交易所根本分不清「人」和「agent」，风控只认 key，不认意图", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 7, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5137, "date": "2026-10-04T10:11:22+08:00", "from": 7008, "text": "做支付的也一样，最怕 agent 手里拿着无限授权", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5138, "date": "2026-10-04T10:12:50+08:00", "from": 7013, "text": "我们团队这周也在吵这个，给 agent 的权限到底怎么配，现在没有一个好方案", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5139, "date": "2026-10-04T10:14:35+08:00", "from": 7010, "text": "+1，这是个真空白。现在所有所都默认「key = 本人」，agent 时代这个假设以经不成立了", "reply_to": 5136, "reactions": 8, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5140, "date": "2026-10-04T10:15:48+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "我昨晚也把 bot 的 key 全关了，先手动几天", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5141, "date": "2026-10-04T10:21:30+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "周六某代币化美股相对周五收盘溢价 3%，到今天早上还挂着 2.6%", "reply_to": 5017, "reactions": 8, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5142, "date": "2026-10-04T10:22:05+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "周六晚上的盘口截图，两边加起来不到 3 万刀", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": { "type": "photo" }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5143, "date": "2026-10-04T10:23:05+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "3% 能套吗？周末又不能申赎", "reply_to": 5141, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5144, "date": "2026-10-04T10:23:50+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "3% 无风险？我上了", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5145, "date": "2026-10-04T10:24:20+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "不是无风险，是无对冲😂", "reply_to": 5144, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5146, "date": "2026-10-04T10:25:42+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "昨晚试了一小把：空代币那边、perp 上做多对冲，扣掉 funding 和滑点基本白干，而且代币那边根本借不到多少货", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5147, "date": "2026-10-04T10:27:10+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "所以这 3% 不是白捡的钱，是没锚的价格在裸奔。周末申赎不了，谁也压不回去", "reply_to": 5146, "reactions": 6, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5148, "date": "2026-10-04T10:28:45+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "那周一开盘会直接砸回去吗？", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5149, "date": "2026-10-04T10:31:02+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "上次差不多的情况，周一开盘十分钟就回到正常价了，周末买在高位的人就是纯亏。用户来问我们，我们也给不出一个「对的价格」", "reply_to": 5148, "reactions": 5, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5150, "date": "2026-10-04T10:32:30+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "说白了周末那 3% 是在交「没人知道真实价格」的税", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5152, "date": "2026-10-04T10:48:12+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "简单复盘一下 Arcbridge（基于目前公开的链上数据，细节以官方复盘为准）：\n攻击者在源链上没有任何锁仓，却在目标链上凭一条伪造的跨链消息铸出了资产，说明消息验证这一环出了问题——要么签名门槛太低，要么验证合约有逻辑漏洞。从第一笔异常铸造到被卖光，中间隔了 40 多分钟，这段时间里只要有人盯着「目标链铸造量 > 源链锁仓量」这一个指标，就能提前喊停。\n更大的问题在用户侧：普通人根本判断不了哪个桥安全。审计报告看不懂，TVL 越大反而越像靶子，验证者是谁、几签几，全藏在文档角落里，大家选桥基本靠「上次用着没出事」。\n我觉得这里有个实打实的机会：做实时的桥风险监控——每个桥持续对账（铸造 vs 锁仓），盯验证者集合和合约升级，一有异常秒级推送告警，再给钱包和 agent 开一个「这个桥现在能不能用」的 API。", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 14, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5153, "date": "2026-10-04T10:52:40+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "所以我们普通人到底该用哪个桥？", "reply_to": 5152, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5154, "date": "2026-10-04T10:54:18+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "说实话没有标准答案，只能分散、少量多次、跨完就走", "reply_to": 5153, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5155, "date": "2026-10-04T10:55:02+08:00", "from": 7003, "text": "那个 API 我第一个用，agent 跨链之前先问一句「这桥今天还能用吗」", "reply_to": 5152, "reactions": 5, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5156, "date": "2026-10-04T10:56:31+08:00", "from": 7008, "text": "+1，支付这边也要，跨链收款最怕桥半路出事", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5157, "date": "2026-10-04T10:57:15+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "我愿意付费，按次 x402 收我都认 hh", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5158, "date": "2026-10-04T10:59:40+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "RWA 这边也离不开桥，客户问我们「你们用的桥安不安全」，说实话我们自己都讲不清", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5159, "date": "2026-10-04T11:03:48+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "监控这事难在误报，狼来了喊多了就没人信了", "reply_to": 5152, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5160, "date": "2026-10-04T11:05:20+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "所以只盯硬指标：目标链铸造量 > 源链锁仓量，这是硬的，不靠猜", "reply_to": 5159, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5161, "date": "2026-10-04T11:08:33+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "我现在跨链只敢走交易所充提，绕一圈也认了", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5162, "date": "2026-10-04T11:21:09+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "We are aware of an exploit affecting Arcbridge. All bridging has been paused while we investigate with our security partners. Please do not interact with Arcbridge contracts until further notice. A full post-mortem will follow.", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": "Arcbridge Announcements" },
    { "message_id": 5163, "date": "2026-10-04T11:22:30+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "经典三连：已知悉、已暂停、复盘稍后", "reply_to": 5162, "reactions": 6, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5164, "date": "2026-10-04T12:02:18+08:00", "from": 7015, "text": "⚠️ 价格提醒｜BTC 1h -1.9%｜现价 $105,240", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5165, "date": "2026-10-04T12:15:40+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "回家路上的煎饼果子，加俩蛋", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": { "type": "photo" }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5166, "date": "2026-10-04T12:16:22+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "加俩蛋，奢侈", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5167, "date": "2026-10-04T13:05:12+08:00", "from": 7008, "text": "午饭后犯困，谁来聊点刺激的", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5168, "date": "2026-10-04T14:12:30+08:00", "from": 7007, "text": "经过昨晚，我在认真想 agent 到底该在 CEX 跑还是 DEX 跑", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5169, "date": "2026-10-04T14:13:44+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "CEX。Binance、OKX 那种深度 DEX 短期追不上，agent 在 DEX 上一跑就是自己砸自己", "reply_to": 5168, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5170, "date": "2026-10-04T14:15:09+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "CEX 的问题是托管，钱不在你手里。上周某所提币卡了两小时，忘了？", "reply_to": 5169, "reactions": 5, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5171, "date": "2026-10-04T14:15:52+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "那次我也碰上了，最后是到了，但那两个小时啥也干不了", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5172, "date": "2026-10-04T14:17:30+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "DEX 至少规则写在合约里，agent 用钱包签名，权限自己能控", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5173, "date": "2026-10-04T14:18:41+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "透明有啥用，滑点也很透明 hh。而且今天 Arcbridge 这种事，链上一样躲不开", "reply_to": 5172, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5174, "date": "2026-10-04T14:19:20+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "那是桥，不是 DEX，别混在一起说", "reply_to": 5173, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5175, "date": "2026-10-04T14:22:55+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "我拿自己的成交算过：单笔 5 万刀以下 DEX 和 CEX 成本差不多，50 万刀以上 CEX 完胜。但 CEX 的成本里应该再加一笔托管风险的「保险费」，这个没人会算", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 6, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5176, "date": "2026-10-04T14:25:31+08:00", "from": 7010, "text": "也许根本不是二选一：执行放 CEX，资金和授权放链上，按需划转", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5177, "date": "2026-10-04T14:26:48+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "按需划转那几分钟就是你的敞口", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5178, "date": "2026-10-04T14:27:30+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "那最后还是得信 CEX 啊", "reply_to": 5176, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5179, "date": "2026-10-04T14:28:15+08:00", "from": 7007, "text": "听完更纠结了，两边都不放心", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5180, "date": "2026-10-04T14:29:02+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "所以结论是？", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5181, "date": "2026-10-04T14:29:40+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "结论是没有结论😂", "reply_to": 5180, "reactions": 5, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5182, "date": "2026-10-04T14:31:15+08:00", "from": 7009, "text": "这个留到 meetup 现场吵吧，我给你们留个辩论环节", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 4, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5183, "date": "2026-10-04T14:48:20+08:00", "from": 7015, "text": "⚠️ 价格提醒｜SOL 15m -2.7%｜现价 $206.3", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5184, "date": "2026-10-04T15:10:36+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "周日下午，那个代币的溢价收到 2.1% 了，成交量也就工作日的零头", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5185, "date": "2026-10-04T15:12:10+08:00", "from": 7002, "text": "量这么小，溢价收窄也说明不了啥，可能就是一两个人砸了几单", "reply_to": 5184, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5186, "date": "2026-10-04T15:40:22+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": { "type": "sticker", "emoji": "🥱" }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5187, "date": "2026-10-04T16:05:47+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "整理了一版 Arcbridge 时间线，按区块高度排的，凑合看", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 7, "media": { "type": "document", "file_name": "arcbridge_incident_timeline.pdf" }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5188, "date": "2026-10-04T16:07:12+08:00", "from": 7003, "text": "牛，从第一笔异常铸造到卖光，真就 40 分钟", "reply_to": 5187, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5189, "date": "2026-10-04T16:09:30+08:00", "from": 7008, "text": "这 40 分钟要是有人盯着，能少亏一大半", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5190, "date": "2026-10-04T16:32:18+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "Polymarket API 在亚洲能用吗？想让 agent 去玩预测市场", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5191, "date": "2026-10-04T16:35:40+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "看地区，各地规则不一样，有的地方是限制访问的。得先看你所在地的规定和它自己的条款，我不敢打包票", "reply_to": 5190, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5192, "date": "2026-10-04T16:36:55+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "好吧，那我先观望", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5193, "date": "2026-10-04T16:38:20+08:00", "from": 7007, "text": "我也想知道，有没有人在亚洲实际跑过的？", "reply_to": 5190, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5194, "date": "2026-10-04T17:15:02+08:00", "from": 7013, "text": "周日还在开会的举手🙋‍♀️", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5195, "date": "2026-10-04T17:15:40+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": { "type": "sticker", "emoji": "🙋" }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5196, "date": "2026-10-04T19:30:11+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "Arcbridge 官方说在跟攻击者谈赏金，退回九成就不追究", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5197, "date": "2026-10-04T19:31:40+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "白帽 10% 经典剧本", "reply_to": 5196, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5198, "date": "2026-10-04T21:05:33+08:00", "from": 7015, "text": "🚨 价格提醒｜BTC 5m -2.9%｜现价 $103,960｜注意波动", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5199, "date": "2026-10-04T21:06:02+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "又插？？连插两天", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5200, "date": "2026-10-04T21:06:40+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": { "type": "sticker", "emoji": "😵" }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5201, "date": "2026-10-04T21:08:15+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "这次没接到，挂单挂太低了", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5202, "date": "2026-10-04T21:10:22+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "插针的时候 DEX 那边滑点直接起飞，下午 CEX/DEX 之争给老王加一分", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5203, "date": "2026-10-04T21:12:30+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "但插针的时候 CEX 也会「系统繁忙」，别忘了", "reply_to": 5202, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5204, "date": "2026-10-04T21:13:45+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "", "reply_to": 5203, "reactions": 0, "media": { "type": "voice", "duration": 34 }, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5205, "date": "2026-10-04T21:15:20+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "听完了，还是不同意 hh", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5207, "date": "2026-10-04T21:42:18+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "这群一天上百条，爬楼爬到眼瞎。谁做个 bot 每天把群聊总结成「痛点 / 机会」发出来，我第一个订阅", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 9, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5208, "date": "2026-10-04T21:43:05+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "总结第一条痛点：群里废话太多，主要是我😂", "reply_to": 5207, "reactions": 7, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5209, "date": "2026-10-04T22:05:40+08:00", "from": 7005, "text": "溢价收到 1.6% 了，等期货开盘看最后能剩多少", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5210, "date": "2026-10-04T22:31:20+08:00", "from": 7014, "text": "周日晚上盘面安静得可怕", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5211, "date": "2026-10-04T22:33:05+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "暴风雨前的宁静 hh", "reply_to": 5210, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5212, "date": "2026-10-04T23:15:09+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "Arcbridge 攻击者地址开始往外分散转了，赏金估计谈不拢", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 3, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5213, "date": "2026-10-04T23:16:30+08:00", "from": 7006, "text": "那用户的钱还能回来吗", "reply_to": 5212, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5214, "date": "2026-10-04T23:18:02+08:00", "from": 7011, "text": "看官方后续吧，以往这种能追回一部分就算不错了", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 1, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5215, "date": "2026-10-04T23:52:47+08:00", "from": 7001, "text": "晚安各位", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5216, "date": "2026-10-05T00:05:44+08:00", "from": 7012, "text": "睡前再看一眼，ETH 又拉回来了", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5217, "date": "2026-10-05T00:30:40+08:00", "from": 7004, "text": "睡了，明天又是插针的一天", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 0, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
    { "message_id": 5218, "date": "2026-10-05T01:12:08+08:00", "from": 7003, "text": "还在调 bug 的举个手，Rust 编译器今天骂了我 200 次", "reply_to": null, "reactions": 2, "media": null, "forward_from": null },
